---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  layouts/homevideo.njk
  ---------------------
  The video homepage: one large YouTube video that plays quietly on a loop,
  filling the window inside the same margins as the galleries, with a button
  to turn the sound on.

  The video is the "youtube" line in src/home-temp.md (a normal YouTube link
  is fine). Edit it from /admin once the entry has been added there.

  Settings on the .hv element:
        data-fit   "cover" (fills the box, cropping the edges as needed)
                   or "contain" (shows the whole picture, with bars if needed)
#}
{% set videoId = youtube | youtubeId %}

<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ site.name }}</h1>

{% if videoId %}
<section class="hv" data-fit="cover" data-video-id="{{ videoId }}">
  <iframe class="hv__frame" data-hv-frame
          src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ videoId }}?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist={{ videoId }}&controls=0&modestbranding=1&rel=0&playsinline=1&iv_load_policy=3&disablekb=1&fs=0&enablejsapi=1"
          title="{{ site.name }} — video"
          allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe>

  {# A clear layer over the video: it stops YouTube's hover title bar and
     buttons from appearing, so the picture stays clean. #}
  <div class="hv__shield"></div>

  <button class="video-sound hv__sound" type="button" data-hv-sound aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Turn sound on" hidden>
    <svg class="video-sound__off" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9v6h4l5 4V5L7 9H3z"/><path d="M16 9l5 6M21 9l-5 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    <svg class="video-sound__on" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9v6h4l5 4V5L7 9H3z"/><path d="M16 8.5a5 5 0 010 7M18.5 6a8.5 8.5 0 010 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
  </button>
</section>
{% else %}
<section class="hv hv--empty">
  <p>Add a YouTube link to the <code>youtube:</code> line in <code>src/home-temp.md</code> to see your video here.</p>
</section>
{% endif %}
